What this project deliberately does not include
------------------------------------------------
The Handsy iOS app, TestFlight, and the Go `esp32agent` CLI (Bluetooth
pairing) are not part of this tree. Control is the COM serial port. Video
is TCP 7201. Port 7202 and BLE pairing are documented as experimental and
are not required.
